  "general": {
    "description": "A self-propelled stump grinder on rubber tracks, driven from the platform at its back. Drive the cutter wheel up to a stump and switch GRIND on: the boom lowers and grinds the stump and its roots away, leaving Mulch, by the same rules as the hand-guided grinder (a stump in the ground, never a standing tree or a log on a floor). Carry it on the equipment trailer.",
